      - DARKNESS
    - index: 1
      functionType: 6
      parameter:
      - JustTextDialogue
      - 10
  - text: No more sanity. No more light.
    displayText: No more sanity. No more light.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.12
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 0
      parameter:
      - DARKNESS
  - text: '```The ECG has flatlined.'
    displayText: The ECG has flatlined.
    color: 5
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.12
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.6, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 6
      parameter:
      - JustTextDialogue
      - 3
  - text: 'If it were a game, Rika would just reset and start again. '
    displayText: 'If it were a game, Rika would just reset and start again. '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0173
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Pause. Load a save file. Continue trying different choices, over and over,
      searching for the correct solution of the puzzle until she beats the odds.
    displayText: Pause. Load a save file. Continue trying different choices, over
      and over, searching for the correct solution of the puzzle until she beats
      the odds.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.01
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "However, Rika's not delusional. She knows she cannot do that.\r"
    displayText: "However, Rika's not delusional. She knows she cannot do that.\r"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0205
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "And she knows that saving her in this dream world would change nothing
      of the real world.\r"
    displayText: "And she knows that saving her in this dream world would change
      nothing of the real world.\r"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0222
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The fact is, this is how it's turned out.
    displayText: The fact is, this is how it's turned out.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.024
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Mahiru''s dead.'
    displayText: Mahiru's dead.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0843
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru's been dead for a long time.
    displayText: Mahiru's been dead for a long time.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0251
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The first friend, and the only friend Rika's ever had, is dead.
    displayText: The first friend, and the only friend Rika's ever had, is dead.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0173
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Dead. Gone. Deceased. With her own hands.
    displayText: Dead. Gone. Deceased. With her own hands.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0208
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Departed.'
    displayText: Departed.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Killed.'
    displayText: Killed.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Unalived.'
    displayText: Unalived.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Lifeless.'
    displayText: Lifeless.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Slaughtered.'
    displayText: Slaughtered.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Empty.'
    displayText: Empty.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Forgotten.'
    displayText: Forgotten.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0503
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```She''s Dead.'
    displayText: She's Dead.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0897
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '```Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead.  '
    displayText: 'Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.  '
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.01
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This is how things turned out. And there's no redoing.
    displayText: This is how things turned out. And there's no redoing.
    color: 5
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.0476
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: 
    textColor: {r: 0.6, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru's Dead.
